---
title: Investigation Session — End-to-End Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SME as SME
    participant Seal as Seal Authority
    participant Gate as Power Gate
    participant Relay as Protection Relays
    participant AI as GPU Platform
    participant LLM as frontier_llm_api
    participant Voice as voice_tag
    participant Store as capsule_store
    participant MCP as mcp_edge

    Note over SME,MCP: System is SEALED. A trip event needs live human investigation.

    SME->>Seal: open_investigation_session(reason="trip on Bus 3")
    Seal->>Seal: verify single-key auth + integrity + legal transition

    alt request rejected
        Seal-->>SME: TransitionReceipt(success=false)
    else request accepted
        Seal->>Gate: enable GPU Platform power rail
        Gate->>AI: power on (boot)
        AI-->>Gate: ready
        Seal->>Relay: enable extra-sensitive trip profile
        Relay-->>Seal: ack
        Seal->>Seal: start 15-min auto-expire timer
        Seal-->>LLM: mode_change(SEALED → INVESTIGATION)
        Seal-->>Voice: mode_change
        Seal-->>MCP: mode_change
        Seal-->>SME: TransitionReceipt(success=true)
    end

    Note over SME,MCP: Active session — read inference allowed, orchestration writes blocked

    SME->>Voice: hold-to-record voice query
    Voice->>Voice: ASR transcribe (local Whisper)
    Voice-->>SME: transcript

    SME->>Store: query_capsules(time_range, novelty > 0.7)
    Store-->>SME: candidate capsules

    SME->>LLM: complete(prompt with token pattern)
    LLM->>LLM: power-gate check<br/>(mode in {BOOTSTRAP, INVESTIGATION} ✓)
    LLM->>AI: POST /complete
    AI-->>LLM: response
    LLM-->>SME: rendered analysis

    SME->>Store: read settings + COMTRADE for capsule
    Store-->>SME: .cfg, .dat, settings

    SME->>MCP: propose_ontology_update(...)
    MCP-->>SME: SealedModeError<br/>(orchestration writes require BOOTSTRAP)

    Note over SME,MCP: Session ends — auto-expire OR manual close

    alt 15-min timer expires (deadman)
        Seal->>Seal: timer fires (system-initiated, no signer)
        Seal->>Seal: compute erase_hash = SHA-256(witness)
        Seal->>Voice: power off microVM (RAM crypto-erased)
        Seal->>LLM: power off microVM
        Seal->>MCP: power off microVM
        Seal->>Gate: disable GPU Platform power rail
        Gate->>AI: power off
        Seal->>Relay: revert to normal protection
        Seal->>Seal: append AuditEntry(<br/>event="investigation_session_expired",<br/>erase_hash=...)
    else SME closes early
        SME->>Seal: close_investigation_session()
        Seal->>Seal: cancel timer
        Note right of Seal: same teardown:<br/>power off VMs, RAM crypto-erase,<br/>power down GPU Platform,<br/>revert relay profile
        Seal->>Seal: append AuditEntry(event="mode_transition")
    end

    Seal-->>LLM: mode_change(INVESTIGATION → SEALED)
    Seal-->>Voice: mode_change
    Seal-->>MCP: mode_change
    Seal-->>SME: any in-flight LLM call → HardwareUnavailableError

    Note over SME,MCP: System SEALED again. Audit hash sealed in permanent memory.
